From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Thu, 29 Oct 2026 15:52:30 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] backend: opt-in local ban check for GET
 /moderation/ban/address/{address}

Implement the moderation.read operation from the public developer OpenAPI
contract only. A supplied ban list (moderationStore / MODERATION_BANS_FILE)
answers true for permanent and unexpired temporary bans and false otherwise,
with expiry evaluated per request. Without a store the existing fixture
replay and 501 fallback are unchanged. No captured website code is used.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
